{
  "$comment": "Reaction picker dataset. Data only - no UI, no rendering. The client consumes this; it does not live inside a component, so a rewrite of the picker does not mean rebuilding the list. Names are the Unicode CLDR short names, which are the names Discord exposes as :shortcodes:, so a name typed by a member here resolves the same way it would there. Categories mirror Discord's own grouping so muscle memory carries over.",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "scope": "A curated subset: the emoji a reaction picker actually needs, not all ~1800. A full set can be generated from CLDR short-name data and dropped in without any code change, since the shape is fixed.",
  "conventions": {
    "name": "CLDR short name, lowercase, no colons. The client adds them.",
    "keywords": "Extra search terms. Optional; omitting them is valid.",
    "skinTones": "Skin-tone variants are NOT enumerated per entry. Apply them at render time from the base code point, so adding tone support does not multiply this file."
  },
